{"3973380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Arcade Games for Pets", "steam_appid": 3973380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HOW &quot;AGFP&quot; CAN HONOR YOUR PET AND HOW YOU CAN SUPPORT STRAY ANIMALS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HOW YOU CAN HONOR A LOST OR YOUR CURRENT COMPANION!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Send us a photo of your beloved pet, their name and a description or a story and we'll include it in the equivalent museum floor (based on their species) for all players to admire!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE FIRST ARCADES! More Arcades will be added in future updates, complimentary to existing owners.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973380/extras/637bf59458ad9de5e67465a72cd6ed12.avif?t=1764546194\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973380/extras_big/637bf59458ad9de5e67465a72cd6ed12.avif?t=1764546194 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;ARKANIA&quot; includes 100 unique levels, various boss fights and many bonus capsules!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973380/extras/3b54db320fd506b3cae4752b933d99e4.avif?t=1764546194\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973380/extras_big/3b54db320fd506b3cae4752b933d99e4.avif?t=1764546194 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play any Arcade, earn decoration tokens and use them to decorate your apartment to your liking! Dozens of decorations are available in various categories.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973380/extras/b86a9ceaa2c85092fc079b717b32d2d6.avif?t=1764546194\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973380/extras_big/b86a9ceaa2c85092fc079b717b32d2d6.avif?t=1764546194 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your smart TV, your office computer or decorate all rooms from scratch.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create and decorate your Arcade room and add your game cabinets, ready to play!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973380/extras/d977a111cd5b1f0d5b0c243abb16741a.avif?t=1764546194\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973380/extras_big/d977a111cd5b1f0d5b0c243abb16741a.avif?t=1764546194 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Play AGFP knowing that you helped an innocent soul with your purchase and please consider rescuing a stray animal in need. Their companionship and love will be priceless!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973380/extras/1001ec5c0cb8e69140dc70e4dd59baa1.avif?t=1764546194\" width=1017 height=263 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HOW &quot;AGFP&quot; CAN HONO